        "x-ros-capability": {
          "kind": "subscribe",
          "name": "/web_demo_chatter",
          "type": "std_msgs/msg/String"
        },
        "description": "Requires the HTTP transport to be started with `sse: true` (`--http-sse` on the CLI). Shipped in rclnodejs 2.1.1. **Not testable via \"Try it out\"**: this response is an unbounded stream that never completes, and API explorers (e.g. Swagger UI) wait for the response body to finish before displaying it, so the request will appear to hang forever. Use `curl -N` or a browser `EventSource` instead.",
